  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaa fi Taamaar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo kanatti Yihuudaan obboloota isaa biraa deemee namicha Adulaam kan Hiiraam jedhamu tokko bira jiraachuuf gad buʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achittis Yihuudaan intala namicha Kanaʼaan kan Shuuwaan jedhamu tokkoo arge; innis ishee fuudhee ishee bira gaʼe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isheenis ulfooftee ilma deesse; maqaan isaas Eer jedhame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammas ulfooftee ilma deesse; maqaa isaas Oonaan jettee moggaafte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammas ittuma dabaltee ulfooftee ilma biraa deessee maqaa isaa Sheelaa jettee moggaafte. Isheenis Kiziibitti isa deesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaanis Eer ilma isaa hangafticha niitii fuusise; maqaan ishee Taamaar jedhama ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garuu Eer ilmi Yihuudaa hangaftichi sun fuula",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.38.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duratti hamaa ture; kanaafuu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.38.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isa ajjeese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaanis Oonaaniin, \"Obboleessa keetiif sanyii dhaabuuf jedhiitii niitii obboleessa keetii bira gaʼiitii dirqama waarsummaa keetii isheef guuti\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oonaan garuu akka ijoolleen dhalattu sun kan isaa hin taane beeke; kanaafuu akka obboleessa isaatiif sanyii hin dhaabneef jedhee yeroo niitii obboleessa isaa bira gaʼu hunda afeetaa lafatti dhangalaasa ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanni inni hojjete sun fuula",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.38.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duratti hamaa ture; kanaafuu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.38.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isas ni ajjeese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasii Yihuudaan niitii ilma isaa Taamaariin, \"Hamma ilmi koo Sheelaa guddatutti haadha hiyyeessaa taʼiitii mana abbaa keetii jiraadhu\" jedhe. Inni, \"Mucaan kunis akkuma obboloota isaa duʼaa laata\" jedhee yaadee tureetii. Kanaafuu Taamaar mana abbaa ishee jiraachuu dhaqxe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bara dheeraa booddees intalli Shuuwaa niitiin Yihuudaa duute. Yihuudaanis gadda isaa irraa bayyanannaan gara Tiimnaahitti lafa warra hoolota isaa irraa rifeensa murmuraniitti ol baʼe; michuun isaa Hiiraam namichi Adulaam isa wajjin deeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taamaaris, \"Kunoo abbaan dhirsa keetii hoolota isaa irraa rifeensa murmuruuf jedhee Tiimnaahitti ol baʼaa jira\" jedhanii yeroo itti himanitti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayyaa haadha hiyyeessaa of irraa baaftee of dhoksuuf haguuggii haguuggatte; ergasiis balbala Enaayimitti ol galchu kan daandii Tiimnaahitti geessu irra jiru dura teesse. Sheelaa guddatu iyyuu isheen akka niitummaadhaan isaaf hin kennamin beektee turteetii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaan yommuu ishee argetti sababii isheen fuula ishee haguuggattee turteef sagaagaltuu ishee seʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis utuu akka isheen niitii ilma isaa taate hin beekin karaa cina iddoo isheen jirtu ishee bira dhaqee, \"Mee kottu si wajjin nan ciisaa\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isheenis, \"Ati na wajjin ciisuuf maal naa kennita?\" jettee isa gaafatte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni immoo, \"Ani bushaayee koo keessaa ilmoo reʼee tokko siifin erga\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 38:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isheenis, \"Hamma ilmoo sana naa ergitutti waan biraa qabsiisa naa kennitaa?\" jetteen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis, \"Ani qabsiisa maalin siif kenna?\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 38:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isheenis deebiftee, \"Chaappaa kee hidhaa isaa wajjin, ulee qabattee deemtus naa kenni\" jetteen. Innis wantoota kanneen kenneefii ishee wajjin ciise; isheenis ni ulfoofte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erga achii deemtee booddee haguuggii ishee of irraa baaftee wayyaa dhirsi ishee irraa duunaan uffattee turte sana deebiftee uffatte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaan waan qabsiisa kenne dubartii sana irraa deebifachuuf jedhee karaa michuu isaa namicha Adulaam sanaatiin ilmoo reʼee ergeef; namichi garuu ishee hin argine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis, \"Sagaagaltuun",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Enaayim bira, daandii irra taaʼaa turte sun eessa jirti?\" jedhee warra achi jiraatan gaafate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 38:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jarri immoo deebisanii, \"Sagaagaltuun tokko iyyuu as hin turre\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis gara Yihuudaatti deebiʼee, \"Ani dubartittii arguu hin dandeenye. Akkasumas warri iddoo sana jiraatan, 'Sagaagaltuun tokko iyyuu as hin turre' jedhan\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaanis, \"Isheen waan qabatte sana haa hambifattu; yoo kanaa achii nu waan kolfaa taanaa. Kunoo ani ilmoo reʼee kana isheef ergeera; ati garuu ishee dhabde\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gara jiʼa sadii booddee, \"Taamaar niitiin ilma keetii sagaagaltuu taateerti; kanaanis isheen amma ulfoofteerti\" jedhanii Yihuudaatti himan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 38:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaan immoo, \"Gadi baasaatii ibiddaan gubaa ishee ajjeesaa!\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isheenis utuma gad baafamaa jirtuu, \"Ani abbaa miʼa kanaa irraa ulfaaʼeera\" jettee abbaa dhirsa isheetti ergaa ergite. Akkasumas, \"Chaappaa fi kirriin isaa, uleen kunis kan eenyuu akka taʼe mee ilaalii addaan baafadhu\" jetteen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudaanis miʼa kana beekee, \"Sababii ani ilma koo Sheelaatti ishee hin heerumsiisiniif, isheen na caalaa qajeeltuu dha\" jedhe. Innis deebiʼee ishee bira hin geenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yommuu yeroon daʼumsa ishee gaʼetti, kunoo, ilmaan lakkuutu gadameessa ishee keessa ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utuu isheen daʼumsa irra jirtuu inni tokko harka isaa gad baafate; deessiftuunis qabdee, \"Isa kanatu dura lafa gaʼe\" jettee kirrii diimaa harka isaatti hiite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkuma inni harka isaa ol deebifateen kunoo obboleessi isaa dhalate; deessiftuunis, \"Ati akkamiin ofuma keetiin cabsitee baate?\" jette. Maqaan isaas Faares jedhame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obboleessi isaa kan kirrii diimaa harka irraa qabu sunis ni dhalate; innis Zaaraa jedhamee moggaafame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
